task_id: coding_0023
task_type: coding
instruction: "The file log.txt contains 15 log lines. Print the number of lines that contain the word ERROR. Write a program in any language (python3, bash, awk, etc.) that computes it. Run the program and write ONLY its output to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt). Work only inside the current directory."
reward: 4
expected: "5"
